ok 6a.1 a missing client file is refused AT STARTUP
ok 6a.2 an asset path that is not absolute is refused
ok 6a.3 an empty asset is refused, not served
ok 6a.4 ACCEPTED: the shipped client at its default path
ok 6a.5 which is read from
ok 6b.1 status
ok 6b.2 content type
ok 6b.3 the body is the client, not a stub
ok 6c.1 the tag itself is 304
ok 6c.2 one member of a list is 304
ok 6c.3 a weak tag is 304, which is the comparison this header uses
ok 6c.4 '*' is 304 for anything that exists
ok 6c.5 ACCEPTED: a tag that does not match gets the file
ok 6c.6 all of it
ok 6d.1 ACCEPTED: GET
ok 6d.2 ACCEPTED: HEAD
